      "text": "2.   decouple upload from transcoding\n\n3.   autoscale consumers\n\n4.   rate limit producers\n\n5.   priority/tiered queue\n\n6.  parition the queue based on user_id or video_id",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.   decouple upload from transcoding\n\n3.   autoscale consumers\n\n4.   rate limit producers\n\n5.   priority/tiered queue\n\n6.  parition the queue based on user_id or video_id",
